---
// Legacy MCP soft-CTA URL — kept alive for clients whose conversation history
// still cites https://getcommit.dev/signup?ref=mcp-cli (the URL emitted by
// Commit MCP server v1.14.0 before 2026-05-20). The Astro redirects map in
// astro.config.mjs would lose the ?ref= query string (meta-refresh hardcodes
// the destination URL), so this page is an explicit JS redirect that
// preserves the query string and lands users on /get-started?ref=… with
// funnel attribution intact.
//
// New CTAs point at /get-started directly — when no traffic hits /signup for
// a few weeks, this page can be deleted and replaced with a config redirect.
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <title>Get your API key — Commit</title>
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex" />
    <link rel="canonical" href="https://getcommit.dev/get-started" />
    <meta http-equiv="refresh" content="0;url=/get-started" />
    <style>
      body { font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; max-width: 480px; margin: 80px auto; text-align: center; color: #333; }
      a { color: #0066cc; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <p>Redirecting to <a id="dest" href="/get-started">/get-started</a>…</p>
    <script is:inline>
      (function () {
        var qs = window.location.search || '';
        var dest = '/get-started' + qs;
        var link = document.getElementById('dest');
        if (link) link.setAttribute('href', dest);
        window.location.replace(dest);
      })();
    </script>
  </body>
</html>
